\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Chain-first annealer with the corrected energy, on one Tesla T4. The per-run values of $c_{\max }$, the population size and the move budget are \emph  {not} uniform across rows; they are listed in Table~\ref {tab:params}. The plateaus reported here were stable across the seeds and the continuations we ran. $^\dagger $The cube entry is a $3$-stage continuation totalling about $24$ minutes: cold ($303$\,s, $662/864$), warm restart ($814$\,s, $820/864$), guided restart ($304$\,s, complete); the $304$\,s is the final guided stage alone, not the whole sequence.}}{8}{table.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
